    {
      "id": "claim_824bb18faeec48b8b14356d7a8b9609b",
      "statement": "Persistent state lives in five per-domain MMKV instances — 'settings' (settingsStore), 'wallet' (walletStore), 'alerts' (alertStore), 'widget' (syncPortfolioWidget), 'position-widget' (syncPositionWidgets) — each created at module scope by exactly one owning module; because MMKV is native storage readable from any JS context, these instances are the handoff medium between the app process and headless widget/background runs, and the regression tests model them as one map per instance id.",
