      "id": "claim_45f658c40dea4198b3567df80717a214",
      "statement": "walletStore.setStoredWalletAddress is a no-op when the address is unchanged, and on a real transition it writes wallet_revision (incremented from the stored value) before writing or removing wallet_address, so MMKV value-changed listeners fired by the address write always observe a complete, self-consistent {address, revision} transition.",
