      "id": "claim_86a712651e464246acb8df5ce5b1d07b",
      "statement": "alertStore keeps one JSON key ('out_of_range_state') mapping wallet address to position-id → in-range from the last background check; getRangeState returns null for an unseen wallet or corrupt JSON, and null means first check — detectOutOfRangeAlerts records state but emits no alerts, preventing a notification storm; clearRangeState removes only that wallet's entry (wiping the whole key if the record is corrupt) and is called from useWalletLifecycle's handleDisconnect so a disconnect leaves no stale alert baseline.",
