      "id": "claim_12e99209dd034ac9ad7eff7dede8a277",
      "statement": "Widget syncs persist monotonic request counters ('latest_request_id' in 'widget', 'request' in 'position-widget') that are bumped at the start of every sync and re-checked together with the wallet snapshot before each cache write and draw; because they live in MMKV, ordering holds across processes and headless module reloads, and renderWidgets performs a final ownership check inside the native draw callback after Android's asynchronous widget lookup; a 'loading_request' value equal to the current request id marks a refresh as in progress.",
